    Fix TypeScript check in modules/lti and add it to CI (#7772)
    
    The CRA→Vite migration (e5d1298c07) removed the Jest toolchain but left
    src/App.test.tsx behind, which relied on Jest's global `it()`. Since no
    test runner exists for this module anymore, this patch removes the
    orphaned file. This also adds a `tsc --noEmit` step to the LTI tools
    workflow so this kind of breakage is caught in CI.
    
    ### How to test this patch
    
    CI should pass.
    
